{{!-- The steading's treasury: the standard currencies down the side, the three denominations across
      the top. Shared by the steading's Play tab and the steadfast sheet.
      Params: coinage (Currency[]), and optionally advice (an "If you want to…" topic key).

      A real table, because this IS one — two currencies by three denominations — and the shape buys
      three things the stacked rows could not. Each denomination is named ONCE instead of once per
      currency, so the words no longer outnumber the numbers they caption. The six values line up in
      columns, which is the only way to read a treasury: you compare silver to gold down a column.
      And every field gets a row and a column header, where before both "Purses" fields carried the
      accessible name "Purses" and nothing said which currency's.

      The block is titled like every other block on the tab. It used to have no heading at all, which
      left the first currency's name row doing double duty as one — and left the advice ? riding that
      row behind a CSS `order` rule to keep the hairline from running through it. --}}
<div class="steading-coinage">
	{{> "stonetop.section-heading" title=(localize "stonetop.steading.lists.coinage") advice=advice}}

	<table class="steading-coinage-table">
		<thead>
			<tr>
				{{!-- The corner. Named for assistive tech and drawn empty: a column of currency names
				      under the word "Currency" restates what the names already say. --}}
				<th scope="col" class="steading-coinage-corner">{{localize "stonetop.steading.coinage.currency"}}</th>
				<th scope="col">{{localize "stonetop.steading.coinage.purses"}}</th>
				<th scope="col">{{localize "stonetop.steading.coinage.handfuls"}}</th>
				<th scope="col">{{localize "stonetop.steading.coinage.coins"}}</th>
			</tr>
		</thead>
		<tbody>
			{{#each coinage}}
				<tr>
					<th scope="row" class="steading-coinage-name">{{localize labelKey}}</th>
					<td class="steading-coinage-cell">
						<span class="stonetop-stepper">
							<input type="number" class="stonetop-coinage-input stonetop-coinage-purses stonetop-step" data-change-action="coinagePurses" min="0"
							       data-title="{{title}}" value="{{purses}}"
							       aria-label="{{localize 'stonetop.a11y.coinagePurses' currency=(localize labelKey)}}">
							{{> "stonetop.stepper-buttons"}}
						</span>
					</td>
					<td class="steading-coinage-cell">
						<span class="stonetop-stepper">
							<input type="number" class="stonetop-coinage-input stonetop-coinage-handfuls stonetop-step" data-change-action="coinageHandfuls" min="0"
							       data-title="{{title}}" value="{{handfuls}}"
							       aria-label="{{localize 'stonetop.a11y.coinageHandfuls' currency=(localize labelKey)}}">
							{{> "stonetop.stepper-buttons"}}
						</span>
					</td>
					<td class="steading-coinage-cell">
						<span class="stonetop-stepper">
							<input type="number" class="stonetop-coinage-input stonetop-coinage-coins stonetop-step" data-change-action="coinageCoins" min="0"
							       data-title="{{title}}" value="{{coins}}"
							       aria-label="{{localize 'stonetop.a11y.coinageCoins' currency=(localize labelKey)}}">
							{{> "stonetop.stepper-buttons"}}
						</span>
					</td>
				</tr>
			{{/each}}
		</tbody>
	</table>
</div>
